{"id":8263933,"html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-transformer/merge_requests/869","number":869,"state":"merged","title":"Fix FAG Sink MM12 Nzout Bug","url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-transformer/pulls/869","issue_url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-transformer/pulls/869/issues","body":"## 描述\n问题/功能描述\n本次PR旨在优化FlashAttention梯度计算内核中SubGrapB函数的执行顺序。主要解决了在启用Sink机制时，数据拷贝输出操作与Sink相关计算之间存在的潜在依赖关系问题。通过调整执行顺序，确保了计算逻辑的正确性和数据流的清晰性，避免了因执行时序不当可能引发的逻辑错误。\n\n修改方案描述\n核心修改是将SubGrapB函数末尾负责将结果vecCopyOutBuffer拷贝到全局内存mulWorkSpaceGm的代码块，整体移动至函数内部的Sink处理逻辑代码块之后。这一调整确保了当Sink机制启用时，必须先完成对dsinkSumLocal的累加等Sink相关计算，再执行最终的数据输出，从而理顺了数据依赖关系，保证了计算结果的正确性。本次变更属于代码逻辑重构，不涉及算法或外部接口的根本性改变。\n\n## 关联的Issue\nhttps://gitcode.com/cann/ops-transformer/issues/514\n\n## 测试\n<!--描述进行了哪些测试来验证你的改动。包括但不限于二级冒烟、算子泛化等。-->\n\n## 文档更新\n<!--如果这个PR包含文档的更新，请在这里指出。例如：更新了README.md文件。-->\n\n## 类型标签\n<!--  [x] 表示选中 -->\n- [ ] Bug修复\n- [ ] 新特性\n- [ ] 性能优化\n- [ ] 文档更新\n- [ ] 其他，请描述：\n\n","assignees_number":2,"assignees":[{"id":"68c1382c7f18604d4aaabbee","login":"mabing1118","name":"mabing","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/mabing1118","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822b81724adff5452d7afc2","login":"monologue815","name":"monologue815","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/monologue815","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false}],"testers":[],"approval_reviewers":[{"id":"6822c65e59bdd61f837dbc5a","login":"yu-xinjie62","name":"於欣洁","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/yu-xinjie62","assignee":false,"code_owner":false,"accept":false,"accept_status":"pending"},{"id":"68c1382c7f18604d4aaabbee","login":"mabing1118","name":"mabing","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/mabing1118","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false,"accept_status":"pending"},{"id":"6822b81724adff5452d7afc2","login":"monologue815","name":"monologue815","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/monologue815","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false,"accept_status":"pending"},{"id":"6822c65c6a68fa1fec6c